  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Health Security (GHS) Project - Early Warning and Surveillance of Infectious Diseases</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objectives of the Early Warning of Surveillance of Infectious Diseases Project are to strengthen early warning surveillance capacities for pre-outbreak detection of infectious agents and the monitoring of new emerging resistant determinants in Low- and Middle-Income Countries (LMICs). The goal of the project is to strengthen early warning systems/tools to support national, regional and global surveillance of zoonotic diseases and AMR.</narrative>
  </description>
